        i="IT support for shops and retail units: tills, card machine connections, back-office computers and customer Wi-Fi supported.",
        a="In a shop, IT problems are measured in lost sales. A till that will not print receipts, a card terminal dropping off Wi-Fi or a stock system that cannot reach the supplier needs fixing around trading hours. We separate till and card traffic from customer Wi-Fi, keep a record of each device and plan changes for quiet times.",
